      "message": "Initially I want to append the logging function exclusively inside dbus_macros but I can\u0027t make it happen nicely since the syn parser can\u0027t seem to cast the enum. Probably I can make it work by comparing strings, but that kinda defeats the purpose of having enum in the first place. \n\nSo I create the logging function in dbus_projection, and there I have a rather ugly implementation since log::info and friends doesn\u0027t accept variable as the 1st parameter, only a plain string literal.\n\nI also have some difficulties to make `DbusLog::log(DbusLog::Enable(DbusLogOptions::LogAll, DbusLogVerbosity::Info)` the default value if none is given, I hope to supply it on line 129 of dbus_projection/dbus_macros/src/lib.rs but the library seems to just refuse creating a Token item from string.\n\nI also find the way of adding `debug_format` cumbersome, but not sure how to improve on that.",
